namespace Ash.OneShot.SourceScheduledCleanupInterfaces.Lexical.Recursive
open ScopedExpressions ScopedExecution ProtectionContracts ProtectionResiduals
open SourcePlannedTyping (Operations Contracts Value)
open SourcePlannedSources (ValueSummary)
open SourceDependencyAnnotations (Dependencies RowAnnotation StoreAnnotation RequirementPath)
open SourceDependencyFrames
open SourceDependencySchemes (Receiving)
open RecursiveDisposalCapture SourceDependencyOwners.Lexical
open SourceDeclarationPlans (Plan ClausePlans)
open SourcePlanSignatures (signature)
open SourcePlannedChecks (Certified CertifiedClauses)
open SourcePlannedRecipeDeclarations (Selected)
open RecursiveRequirements (Requirements Store evaluate)
open OwnerPhaseTransitions (available spend spendAll)
open SourceDependencySchemes.Closing (Bound)
open SourceDependencySchemes.Lexical
